<title>USA: St. Louis Park, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>St. Louis Park, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $9.570 million of St. Louis Park, Minn., general obligation tax increment bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.2978 percent.</p>
</text>
